    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Articulated wooden artist's mannequin with a pale lacquered body, darker wood ball joints at the shoulders, elbows, wrists, hips, knees and ankles, a separate head ovoid, a segmented torso and shaped hands and feet. Every ball joint is real geometry with a visible gap rather than a painted circle, and the joints read correctly from all eight orbits. Style fit is 4 because it is a plain reference figure by design rather than a detailed character. Rigged: 54-bone humanoid armature (24 body + 30 finger bones), walk and run clips, zero unweighted skinned vertices.",
    "limitations": [
      "AI-assisted origin is disclosed upstream (origin.ai_content); some storefronts require an AI-content disclosure when you resell.",
      "The mannequin is rigged with the standard humanoid skeleton, so its ball joints are driven by bones rather than being separate props.",
      "Deliberately featureless face."
    ],
